    },
    {
      "id": "claim_17b1689c63844d509e402650c36613fa",
      "statement": "The StockMovement.grams column is overloaded: it stores gram amounts for weight-tracked items but unit counts for unit-tracked items. create_batch stores units_remaining in grams for unit batches and scan_barcode stores grams=1 per unit scan, and scripts/low_stock.py sums movement.grams across both tracking types to estimate weekly consumption.",
